In this directory, the file

all.conf

contains some of the available options for KSP.

The following files:

cord.conf
negative.conf
negative_ordered.conf
ordered.conf
plain.conf
positive.conf

contain the configurations used for the evaluation of KSP (IJCAR 2016 paper). The files in "jar-2020" were used for the evalution in the submission to the JAR paper. The files in "cade-28" were used for the evaluation in the submission to CADE-28 (2021). The files in "ijcar-2022" were used in the experimentation in the submissions for IJCAR 2022 and CADE-29. Some other examples are given here:

cord_early_mlple.conf
ordered_selection.conf
cord_s4_simp.conf



